# OpenID client of QemuWeb, included by the Apache site (stages 2 and 3 of install-cremi.md).
# Copy this file to /etc/apache2/qemuweb-oidc.inc (root, mode 0600), then replace the three CHANGE_ME
# values by the ones of the reference site (same OpenID client). The real file never goes in the repository.
OIDCClientID CHANGE_ME
OIDCClientSecret CHANGE_ME
OIDCCryptoPassphrase CHANGE_ME
